OL,3,GNEWSAChildren in care to get #10 a week
OL,4,Asavings
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new government savings scheme will
OL,7,Fset aside #10 a week for children in
OL,8,Fcare for them to access when they turn
OL,9,F18.
OL,11,FEstablished by the States' Children and
OL,12,FFamily Community Services and Guernsey
OL,13,FCommunity Savings, it is designed to
OL,14,Fgive young people a financial
OL,15,Ffoundation when becoming an adult.
OL,17,FThe States said the scheme will apply
OL,18,Fto children from entry into the care
OL,19,Fsystem and 40 will benefit immediately.
