OL,4,Asavings
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssociate director of children services
OL,7,FLucy Cook said the savings accounts
OL,8,Fwould support young people by "helping
OL,9,Fthem to access opportunities that might
OL,10,Fotherwise be out of reach."
